o pay year-end bills.   \par \par \uc2 On Thursday, they said demand was also fuelled by the need to service dollar credits and conversion of \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  earned during the September election campaign.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said demand for dollars could well be maintained through Ukraine's long New Year and Orthodox celebrations that continue until January 8. (Editing by Ron Askew)   \par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 HRYVNIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071216e3cd000eh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
