rise, with the State Statistics Committee announcing on Wednesday that the figure had climbed to $3.747 billion in the first five months of the year against $2.71 billion a year ago.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials last week said there were no grounds for any change in exchange rate policy in the immediate future.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070712e37c001yh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
