\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine c. bank sells dollars for 2nd time in week  \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Januar 2007\par 14:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds dealers' comment)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Jan 18 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday, selling dollars at 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a second time this week, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> started sliding at the end of last week, breaking through the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's support level of 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  on tight dollar supply early in the year.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it is committed to upholding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability and resumed its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is selling today. But today demand (for dollars) is not so high as previously," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 "Just a few large dollar buyers came into the market in the afternoon trade and the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has started sliding a bit. But when the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  breaks through the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's level, than those who can afford it wait for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened at around 5.057-5.063 to the dollar but then it slid to about 5.063-5.067 per dollar. The deals were done at around 5.058-5.062 to the dollar, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps tight controls over the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently, both buying and selling hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  within a corridor of 5.00-5.06 to the dollar. It has defended these levels for about two years already.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars on Tuesday.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070118e31i001b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
