last week.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was selling dollars at the start of December. It last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars on October 30.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|BNX|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061219e2cj001f7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
