\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's c.bank buys dollars first time in week  \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 September 2006\par 15:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds details, quotes)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Sept 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday, buying dollars at 5.00 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time in a week, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps a close watch over the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently, both buying and selling hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  within its virtual peg of 5.00-5.06 to the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 It has defended those levels for over a year.  \par \par \uc2 "Today the trading started at about 5.02 (\b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  per dollar). But closer to midday a seller with a fair amount of dollars came out and quotes have started to slide," a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer in Kiev said.  \par \par \uc2 "It looks like by this time all bids have been covered on the market and this bank had to sell dollars to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 5.00 (\b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  per dollar)."  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market on Sept. 15.  \par \par \uc2 Officials have previously said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may buy about $1 billion on the interbank market to replenish its reserves.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  from political instability linked to a talks over a new coalition government.  \par \par \uc2 The bank sold $2.1 billion in January to April but switched to purchases in May, buying around $1.8 billion since then.  \par \par \uc2 "There is enough hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market. Considering that some commercial banks plan to borrow abroad, the situation is unlikely to change by the end of the year," another dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060921e29l001m3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
