\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's c.bank buys dollars for 5th day  \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 2006\par 14:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds comments, details, background)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, June 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday, buying dollars at 5.00 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the fifth trading day running, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The bank, which keeps a close watch over the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  nearly daily this month due to a steady dollar supply as Ukrainian companies and banks rushed to take foreign borrowing.  \par \par \uc2 "I think one of the major (dollar) sellers came onto the market late and sold the cash to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a dealer said. "For now there is enough hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market."  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have said they hope to continue dollar purchases on the interbank market in the summer months to replenish bank's hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.  \par \par \uc2 The bank sold $2.1 billion in January to April to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  from political uncertainty after a parliamentary poll in March and wrangling over a new govermment which has yet to be formed.  \par \par \uc2 In May the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $244 million.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers say that dollar demand picked up slightly in the last two trading days fuelled by car importers but said the trend was likely to be short-lived.  \par \par \uc2 "For now I do not feel the dollar will be strengthening. There can be short-lived fluctuations in demand and supply," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060626e26q000zk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
