ne. This month, the frequency of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has proved higher than in May. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $244 million in May and about $47 million in the first two weeks of June.  \par \par \uc2 It sold $2.1 billion in the first four months.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060623e26n000zz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
