xpect the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slip by year-end."  \par \par \uc2 Ukraine, which imports up to 80 percent of its energy resources, faces a possible increase in prices for Russian gas later this year.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|BNX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060621e26l000zd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
