highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will rise in the fourth quarter, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell reserves to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060620e26k000qp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
