ghlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies would now depend on the success of slow-moving talks to put together a new coalition government. Politicians have been locked in negotiations on the government since a new parliament was elected on March 26.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars through the first four months of the year, but switched to purchases in May as political tensions dropped after the election.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060613e26d001dy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
