 \highlight\uc2  nearly every day since the start of the year, spending over $1.8 billion from its reserves. Last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  interevened only on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060417e24h000om\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
