rket trend was changing.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said exporters, who were delaying hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales due to political instability, were coming on to the market more actively this week.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060331e23v001et\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
