difficult, extending for 5-6 weeks yet," said Tim Ash from Bear Stearns in London. "Uncertainty is set to continue, putting downside pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  and markets."  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060329e23t000xu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
